WEBVTT

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:54.116
DEAR X

00:00:54.741 --> 00:00:56.827
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.620
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

00:01:01.331 --> 00:01:02.374
Jun-seo.

00:01:05.377 --> 00:01:06.753
Help me.

00:01:12.301 --> 00:01:14.052
I want to learn to love him.

00:01:18.015 --> 00:01:19.016
Heo In-gang.

00:01:24.062 --> 00:01:26.064
LENA
YOU HAVE TO STAY AWAY FROM HER

00:01:26.148 --> 00:01:28.942
SHE'S A COMPLETE PSYCHO

00:01:29.026 --> 00:01:31.028
TEN PLANET RYU JI-HYEOK
HEY, CONGRATS ON THE AWARD

00:01:31.111 --> 00:01:32.946
I ENJOYED YOUR NEW MOVIE

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:34.781
YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE
STILL IN THE SHOWBIZ

00:01:34.865 --> 00:01:36.366
IS EVERYTHING GOOD?

00:02:26.041 --> 00:02:27.584
Why are you here?

00:02:29.169 --> 00:02:31.338
I asked you a question.
Didn't you hear me--

00:02:32.047 --> 00:02:33.090
What's this?

00:02:33.799 --> 00:02:35.008
Get out!

00:02:36.426 --> 00:02:37.636
Get your hands off me.

00:02:37.719 --> 00:02:40.722
I'm no longer someone
you can lay hands on.

00:02:41.265 --> 00:02:43.976
So you've got a pretty face
and a few seconds of fame.

00:02:44.059 --> 00:02:46.520
How long do you think you'll last
in a place you don't belong?

00:02:46.812 --> 00:02:48.021
Go ahead. Thrash around.

00:02:49.231 --> 00:02:52.651
You think you can hide the fact
that you killed your parents?

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:55.195
The one thrashing is you.

00:02:55.487 --> 00:02:59.825
It must burn you up
that a nobody like me is thriving.

00:03:02.869 --> 00:03:04.079
It makes me laugh

00:03:04.621 --> 00:03:06.206
when you do this now.

00:03:07.624 --> 00:03:08.625
You little--

00:03:14.381 --> 00:03:16.300
Why do you think I came to Jun-seo?

00:03:17.801 --> 00:03:20.679
You should have kept quiet
if you didn't want to see me.

00:03:20.762 --> 00:03:22.264
What was your plan

00:03:23.223 --> 00:03:24.224
going to my boss?

00:03:24.516 --> 00:03:25.851
Do I have to spell it out?

00:03:26.893 --> 00:03:29.938
To expose your ugly truth.

00:03:30.022 --> 00:03:31.773
People deserve to know

00:03:32.107 --> 00:03:35.277
that you've got
way too much dirt to be on TV.

00:03:36.528 --> 00:03:38.363
I'm going to tell them all.

00:03:39.406 --> 00:03:42.034
Your smiles and your tears...

00:03:42.117 --> 00:03:43.327
They're all fake.

00:03:43.952 --> 00:03:46.496
You act helpless and pitiful
when it benefits you.

00:03:46.913 --> 00:03:49.124
And now you're acting
like nothing's wrong.

00:03:52.586 --> 00:03:55.464
You think I don't know
you killed both your parents?

00:03:55.547 --> 00:03:57.632
You little devil. Die!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.968
Die! Die already!

00:04:00.052 --> 00:04:01.094
Die!

00:04:02.262 --> 00:04:04.056
- You--
- What are you doing?

00:04:04.639 --> 00:04:05.766
Ah-jin.

00:04:06.266 --> 00:04:07.267
Jun-seo.

00:04:07.559 --> 00:04:08.643
Jun-seo.

00:04:10.228 --> 00:04:11.229
Did you see that?

00:04:16.693 --> 00:04:19.071
I'm still stuck in that hell.

00:04:22.199 --> 00:04:23.283
Now you get it.

00:04:25.952 --> 00:04:26.995
Ah-jin.

00:04:27.829 --> 00:04:28.830
Ah-jin.

00:04:29.664 --> 00:04:31.625
Jun-seo...

00:04:33.585 --> 00:04:34.961
Ah-jin.

00:04:36.213 --> 00:04:37.381
Let me drive you home.

00:05:00.904 --> 00:05:05.826
EPISODE 6: SETTING THE TRAP

00:06:07.304 --> 00:06:09.347
Cut. Great work today.

00:06:09.431 --> 00:06:11.349
- Good job, everyone.
- Good work.

00:06:14.561 --> 00:06:15.812
Good job.

00:06:15.896 --> 00:06:17.522
- Good work.
- Good work, guys.

00:06:17.606 --> 00:06:19.191
- Thank you, everyone.
- Good work.

00:06:19.274 --> 00:06:20.692
- Good job.
- Great job.

00:06:20.775 --> 00:06:22.194
- Thank you.
- Great work.

00:06:22.277 --> 00:06:24.237
I learned a lot, thanks to you.

00:06:24.321 --> 00:06:25.906
Great work today.

00:06:28.617 --> 00:06:29.743
Ah-jin.

00:06:31.828 --> 00:06:33.205
Do you have a minute?

00:06:39.044 --> 00:06:42.088
You know I used to be in an idol band

00:06:42.547 --> 00:06:43.632
right?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.261
There was a member, Ji-hyeok

00:06:49.763 --> 00:06:51.556
who was more popular than me.

00:06:53.141 --> 00:06:54.726
One day at lunch

00:06:56.436 --> 00:06:58.980
he ate some macarons
from a fan and got sick.

00:07:00.607 --> 00:07:03.193
I was rushed in as a substitute host.

00:07:03.777 --> 00:07:07.906
The broadcast folks
noticed me that day

00:07:08.281 --> 00:07:09.908
and that's how I ended up here.

00:07:13.453 --> 00:07:14.454
But...

00:07:17.332 --> 00:07:20.377
I knew from the start

00:07:21.461 --> 00:07:23.255
that those macarons contained nuts.

00:07:26.383 --> 00:07:28.969
I saw him eating them

00:07:30.762 --> 00:07:32.347
but kept my mouth shut.

00:07:33.723 --> 00:07:36.518
He left the industry
and does something else now.

00:07:38.103 --> 00:07:41.273
But whenever he sees me on TV,
he sends messages to cheer me on.

00:07:44.025 --> 00:07:45.610
Every time he does that, I wonder.

00:07:48.446 --> 00:07:52.158
"Does he know
that I knew and said nothing?

00:07:53.159 --> 00:07:57.872
Is he getting back at me
by texting me

00:07:58.665 --> 00:08:00.709
or does he really wish me well?"

00:08:01.793 --> 00:08:05.380
Whichever it is,
both are hell for me.

00:08:07.007 --> 00:08:09.676
What are you trying to say?

00:08:10.635 --> 00:08:12.429
The video at the anniversary party.

00:08:13.388 --> 00:08:14.389
I enjoyed it.

00:08:21.688 --> 00:08:23.565
Watching you claw your way up

00:08:24.316 --> 00:08:27.235
reminds me of my younger self,
so here's some advice.

00:08:28.236 --> 00:08:30.739
You're going to do fine without that.

00:08:32.574 --> 00:08:34.534
I just don't want you to end up
regretting it like me.

00:08:36.036 --> 00:08:37.120
As your senior

00:08:38.163 --> 00:08:40.165
I'll always be rooting for you.

00:09:08.652 --> 00:09:11.196
NO CALLER ID

00:09:14.532 --> 00:09:16.159
NO CALLER ID

00:09:16.242 --> 00:09:17.702
DECEMBER 25, SATURDAY

00:09:22.332 --> 00:09:25.460
NO CALLER ID

00:09:27.879 --> 00:09:28.880
Ms. Baek Ah-jin.

00:09:29.547 --> 00:09:31.800
I need you to come here.

00:09:31.883 --> 00:09:33.593
How did you get my number?

00:09:33.677 --> 00:09:35.261
It wasn't so hard.

00:09:36.262 --> 00:09:38.473
Anyway, that's not the point.

00:09:38.556 --> 00:09:41.643
We need to finish our talk
from last time.

00:09:42.769 --> 00:09:44.312
I've got nothing to say.

00:09:44.938 --> 00:09:48.358
Then who should I tell
your secret to?

00:09:49.401 --> 00:09:50.402
Ms. Baek.

00:09:50.985 --> 00:09:53.613
Are you okay with me
spilling your past

00:09:53.697 --> 00:09:56.783
to whomever I want, huh?

00:10:00.078 --> 00:10:01.538
Fine, send me the address.

00:10:14.884 --> 00:10:16.886
Honestly, I don't get it.

00:10:17.554 --> 00:10:20.807
All the other groups still hang out
after they disband.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.975
But look at us.

00:10:22.475 --> 00:10:23.810
We always meet separately.

00:10:26.104 --> 00:10:27.105
So?

00:10:27.522 --> 00:10:28.940
What's your point?

00:10:29.023 --> 00:10:32.068
Frankly, you're the one
I don't get most.

00:10:32.152 --> 00:10:33.153
Right.

00:10:33.236 --> 00:10:35.905
It's not like Ji-hyeok ending up
at the ER was your fault.

00:10:35.989 --> 00:10:38.241
And you filling in
as a substitute host?

00:10:38.324 --> 00:10:40.410
Dude, that was ages ago.

00:10:42.662 --> 00:10:43.830
You done?

00:10:44.998 --> 00:10:46.750
You're really not going to see him?

00:10:49.252 --> 00:10:50.712
He misses you.

00:10:51.379 --> 00:10:52.380
You know that.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.980
Man, this feels good.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.272
Enjoying the view?

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.400
What the heck are you doing?

00:12:35.483 --> 00:12:37.277
I thought about it

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:40.238
and I figured I should show you
rather than tell you.

00:12:41.698 --> 00:12:42.949
Take a good look.

00:12:43.032 --> 00:12:44.534
That's your future.

00:12:45.201 --> 00:12:47.370
See the kid in the blue hoodie?

00:12:51.666 --> 00:12:53.710
Doesn't he look familiar?

00:12:55.545 --> 00:12:57.380
When he was a rookie,
his bullying past came out

00:12:57.463 --> 00:12:59.090
so his career died instantly.

00:12:59.173 --> 00:13:00.800
He was finished.

00:13:00.884 --> 00:13:02.719
But people already knew his face.

00:13:02.802 --> 00:13:04.971
He was young but had no skills.

00:13:05.054 --> 00:13:06.723
Yet he still wanted to party.

00:13:06.806 --> 00:13:08.349
So, what happens?

00:13:08.433 --> 00:13:11.436
He starts bouncing around clubs,
popping whatever he finds.

00:13:11.519 --> 00:13:13.396
Then he ran into me.

00:13:15.148 --> 00:13:17.567
You're next, Ah-jin.

00:13:20.987 --> 00:13:22.071
Look forward to it.

00:13:22.864 --> 00:13:24.657
As much as my life burned down

00:13:25.617 --> 00:13:28.953
your life will also

00:13:29.621 --> 00:13:30.914
come to an end.

00:13:54.437 --> 00:13:55.772
I hoped I was wrong.

00:13:57.982 --> 00:13:59.484
But it really was you, Ah-jin.

00:14:08.284 --> 00:14:09.494
Does Ms. Seo know?

00:14:10.995 --> 00:14:13.206
That you're slipping
in and out of VIP rooms?

00:14:14.999 --> 00:14:17.543
I didn't want to be there.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.630
Someone called me there.

00:14:20.713 --> 00:14:23.716
So, if someone calls

00:14:24.509 --> 00:14:25.885
you go no matter the place?

00:14:25.969 --> 00:14:28.471
Why do you phrase it like that?

00:14:28.554 --> 00:14:30.807
No, why do you live like that?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.183
If you think it's unfair, tell me.

00:14:32.266 --> 00:14:34.811
Who summoned you to that VIP room?

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.817
Of course, you won't say.

00:14:42.026 --> 00:14:43.027
Get out of my car.

00:14:48.116 --> 00:14:50.118
You can go to whoever calls you.

00:14:55.039 --> 00:14:56.582
I said, get out.

00:15:23.026 --> 00:15:24.360
Well, well.

00:15:24.444 --> 00:15:27.405
Jae-oh is finally working with me.

00:15:27.864 --> 00:15:29.699
Why the sudden change of heart?

00:15:29.782 --> 00:15:30.992
Nothing.

00:15:31.075 --> 00:15:33.995
I heard I'd make good money
if I worked for you.

00:15:35.663 --> 00:15:37.040
Plus, you're human, too.

00:15:37.123 --> 00:15:40.293
There's got to be
something I can learn from you.

00:15:40.376 --> 00:15:41.419
What did you say?

00:15:43.713 --> 00:15:46.382
I just want to be useful for once.

00:15:49.761 --> 00:15:52.680
Anyway, this job.

00:15:52.764 --> 00:15:54.474
It's legit, right?

00:15:54.557 --> 00:15:56.517
It's not illegal or anything?

00:15:56.601 --> 00:15:59.020
You punk. I'm done with that stuff.

00:15:59.103 --> 00:16:02.523
We help people who need it
and get paid fair.

00:16:03.107 --> 00:16:05.485
And you can find anyone
if you work for me.

00:16:05.568 --> 00:16:06.569
Even your girl.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.654
Gosh.

00:16:09.113 --> 00:16:10.323
What girl?

00:16:11.449 --> 00:16:12.533
You know, the broom.

00:16:13.868 --> 00:16:15.203
How do you know about the broom?

00:16:15.286 --> 00:16:18.915
That girl with the broom-head hair
you sketched in lockup every day.

00:16:18.998 --> 00:16:21.125
I've got eyes, kid.

00:16:21.709 --> 00:16:23.169
I don't need to look for her.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.338
I already know where she is.

00:16:25.421 --> 00:16:28.091
What good is knowing
if you can't even meet her?

00:16:28.174 --> 00:16:29.342
You never know.

00:16:29.634 --> 00:16:31.260
Maybe someday I'll meet her.

00:16:31.344 --> 00:16:33.846
That's why I'm busting my ass now!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.098
Okay, then.

00:16:35.181 --> 00:16:38.684
To hardworking Jae-oh,
it's time for your first gig.

00:16:40.895 --> 00:16:41.896
What is it?

00:16:48.236 --> 00:16:49.362
A police officer?

00:16:50.571 --> 00:16:52.657
You said it wasn't illegal!

00:16:53.616 --> 00:16:54.951
He's a substation cop.

00:16:55.034 --> 00:16:57.954
The client wants everything.
Dig up every bit of information

00:16:58.037 --> 00:17:00.039
real or not.

00:17:03.543 --> 00:17:05.169
Jeez.

00:17:05.628 --> 00:17:07.839
How do I even find
information on a cop?

00:17:09.382 --> 00:17:12.468
- We need more kimchi.
- Coming right up.

00:17:15.638 --> 00:17:17.223
Ma'am, do you have an empty table?

00:17:17.306 --> 00:17:19.851
You'll have to sit with someone else.
Is that okay?

00:17:19.934 --> 00:17:20.935
Sure.

00:17:27.525 --> 00:17:28.818
Excuse me.

00:17:38.536 --> 00:17:40.121
One radish soup, please.

00:17:40.204 --> 00:17:41.205
Sure thing.

00:17:49.964 --> 00:17:53.301
Oh, man. I'm so sorry.

00:17:53.384 --> 00:17:54.927
- My bad.
- Be careful.

00:17:55.011 --> 00:17:56.929
- I'm really sorry.
- Jeez, never mind.

00:18:04.061 --> 00:18:05.438
Gosh.

00:18:09.066 --> 00:18:10.193
I apologize.

00:18:10.276 --> 00:18:11.277
Forget it.

00:18:14.447 --> 00:18:16.824
- I'll pay now.
- Okay.

00:18:18.492 --> 00:18:20.745
Thank you for coming.
Have a nice day.

00:18:36.177 --> 00:18:38.304
TRANSMITTING

00:18:39.347 --> 00:18:41.807
TRANSIMITTING, 50 PERCENT

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:44.018
TRANSIMITTING, 75 PERCENT

00:18:48.689 --> 00:18:49.815
TRANSIMITTING, 88 PERCENT

00:18:52.401 --> 00:18:53.486
TRANSIMITTING, 99 PERCENT

00:18:54.153 --> 00:18:56.113
TRANSIMITTING, 100 PERCENT

00:18:57.531 --> 00:18:58.574
Your phone.

00:18:58.658 --> 00:18:59.784
You took mine, right?

00:18:59.867 --> 00:19:01.410
- Yes.
- Here.

00:19:01.494 --> 00:19:02.995
They looked exactly the same.

00:19:19.345 --> 00:19:20.554
Lieutenant Park Dae-ho?

00:19:21.055 --> 00:19:22.348
I'm here.

00:19:22.431 --> 00:19:24.267
- Reporter Lim?
- Yes, nice to meet you.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.351
Hi.

00:19:25.977 --> 00:19:26.978
Have a seat.

00:19:34.318 --> 00:19:35.695
One iced Americano, please.

00:19:36.237 --> 00:19:37.405
That will be 4,000 won.

00:19:42.159 --> 00:19:43.911
You know who Baek Ah-jin is, right?

00:19:44.412 --> 00:19:45.955
I know her very well.

00:19:46.038 --> 00:19:49.125
We were really close, she and I.

00:19:49.208 --> 00:19:50.334
Right.

00:19:50.418 --> 00:19:53.129
I can tell from your tone
that you two were close.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.756
- You think so?
- Yes.

00:19:57.383 --> 00:19:59.844
- Who hired you for this?
- What?

00:19:59.927 --> 00:20:02.013
Who hired you
for that background check on the cop?

00:20:05.891 --> 00:20:07.018
- Hello?
- What's this?

00:20:07.101 --> 00:20:09.937
"Nojeong-dong rooftop house murder"?
"Baek Ah-jin"?

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.523
Who am I speaking to?

00:20:12.606 --> 00:20:13.983
We need to meet up.

00:20:14.066 --> 00:20:15.276
Who the heck are you?

00:20:15.359 --> 00:20:16.944
Did you forget my voice?

00:20:17.028 --> 00:20:18.112
It's Kim Jae-oh.

00:20:22.199 --> 00:20:23.200
Explain.

00:20:23.659 --> 00:20:26.370
Why did Ah-jin's name come up
with a murder case?

00:20:26.454 --> 00:20:28.289
- You know something?
- Sit.

00:20:28.622 --> 00:20:29.832
I'll explain.

00:20:32.376 --> 00:20:35.755
She didn't exactly kill him.

00:20:35.838 --> 00:20:38.549
But it's not like she didn't, either.

00:20:39.717 --> 00:20:40.718
It makes you curious, right?

00:20:40.801 --> 00:20:43.220
Other reporters found it hilarious.

00:20:44.263 --> 00:20:45.681
You have proof, yes?

00:20:45.765 --> 00:20:47.099
I'm a police officer.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.227
We're going to crush her
for good, right?

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.399
Is this real?

00:20:56.192 --> 00:20:57.485
Did she actually kill--

00:20:57.568 --> 00:20:59.153
No, definitely not.

00:21:00.112 --> 00:21:02.490
Someone else did it,
and he's in prison now.

00:21:02.573 --> 00:21:05.451
A cop tried to frame her back then,
got punished

00:21:05.534 --> 00:21:07.286
and has held a grudge ever since.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.788
That cop is

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.331
Park Dae-ho?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:11.791
Yes.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.254
So, does that mean
Ah-jin almost got arrested?

00:21:18.339 --> 00:21:21.342
What were you doing
while all that happened to her?

00:21:22.343 --> 00:21:24.261
There was nothing I could do then.

00:21:26.097 --> 00:21:28.391
Don't tell me
you're also suspecting her.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.268
She was cleared without a charge

00:21:31.352 --> 00:21:33.145
and there hasn't been
a problem since.

00:21:33.229 --> 00:21:35.731
She'll be in trouble
if the press gets wind of this now.

00:21:35.815 --> 00:21:38.025
And that cop is nasty.

00:21:38.317 --> 00:21:39.777
Who knows what he might try?

00:21:45.533 --> 00:21:47.201
I only saw her on TV

00:21:48.119 --> 00:21:49.870
so I thought she was doing fine.

00:21:53.374 --> 00:21:54.417
Tell me what to do.

00:21:55.334 --> 00:21:56.502
I'll help.

00:22:04.385 --> 00:22:06.303
How is it going with Lieutenant Park?

00:22:07.179 --> 00:22:08.305
I'm still on it.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:11.142
I have most of his movements
mapped out.

00:22:12.518 --> 00:22:15.813
He'll go wild
if you poke him carelessly.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:17.815
Do it right.

00:22:18.357 --> 00:22:20.568
Don't worry. We've got help.

00:22:20.651 --> 00:22:21.777
Help?

00:22:21.861 --> 00:22:23.070
Open the door.

00:22:26.532 --> 00:22:27.533
Open it!

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.493
You'll be glad to see him, too.

00:22:35.666 --> 00:22:37.376
Took you long enough.

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:40.004
Do you know how long I waited
out here because of you?

00:22:40.087 --> 00:22:42.089
I almost froze to death for beer.

00:22:42.173 --> 00:22:44.467
Well, you back now, so say hi.

00:22:45.468 --> 00:22:47.178
But it's so late. Say hi to who?

00:22:56.395 --> 00:22:58.564
It's been a long time, Jae-oh.

00:23:02.985 --> 00:23:04.570
You scared me.

00:23:11.118 --> 00:23:12.953
I got out last December.

00:23:13.704 --> 00:23:15.873
I served four full years.

00:23:16.916 --> 00:23:18.542
What do you do now?

00:23:20.085 --> 00:23:21.670
Well...

00:23:21.754 --> 00:23:26.217
I just take action
when the office gives me an order.

00:23:26.592 --> 00:23:30.346
Deliveries, transfers, transport...

00:23:30.429 --> 00:23:31.722
All kinds of stuff.

00:23:37.603 --> 00:23:38.604
DIRECT SOLUTION

00:23:38.687 --> 00:23:40.147
And I do background checks.

00:23:41.273 --> 00:23:44.151
And some odd jobs
when there's nothing else.

00:23:48.948 --> 00:23:49.949
Hey.

00:23:51.784 --> 00:23:54.411
I thought you'd ignore me
now that you're a celebrity.

00:23:54.745 --> 00:23:55.829
You're pretty loyal.

00:23:58.666 --> 00:23:59.833
Back off.

00:24:00.709 --> 00:24:01.835
No.

00:24:03.963 --> 00:24:07.258
I want a good look at my friend.
What's wrong with that?

00:24:09.260 --> 00:24:10.261
"Friend"?

00:24:11.303 --> 00:24:13.305
Since when were you my friend?

00:24:14.723 --> 00:24:16.308
You're right.

00:24:17.226 --> 00:24:18.227
Boss?

00:24:20.854 --> 00:24:23.774
Make time for me sometime.
The boss will buy you dinner.

00:24:23.857 --> 00:24:25.109
Are you for real?

00:24:25.484 --> 00:24:28.612
Then I'm asking
for a very expensive meal.

00:24:29.029 --> 00:24:30.239
Like what?

00:24:32.491 --> 00:24:33.617
Trouble pasta.

00:24:34.410 --> 00:24:36.662
You mean "truffle," idiot.

00:24:37.162 --> 00:24:38.664
That stuff is crazy expensive.

00:24:39.873 --> 00:24:42.126
- Name it. It's on me.
- More?

00:24:42.209 --> 00:24:43.961
- What else?
- Chuck flap tail?

00:24:44.044 --> 00:24:45.462
Chuck flap tail?

00:24:45.921 --> 00:24:47.172
Burgers, pizza.

00:24:47.256 --> 00:24:48.841
- That's what you want?
- Jjajangmyeon.

00:24:49.592 --> 00:24:50.843
- And this.
- What is that?

00:24:50.926 --> 00:24:53.429
- You know, they drop it like this.
- What?

00:25:30.090 --> 00:25:31.175
Get in.

00:25:39.308 --> 00:25:40.559
What's this?

00:25:40.643 --> 00:25:41.769
It's for you.

00:25:42.269 --> 00:25:43.354
It's a burner phone.

00:25:44.396 --> 00:25:45.606
Drive safely, sir!

00:26:02.623 --> 00:26:03.624
Hey.

00:26:04.667 --> 00:26:06.001
Come to think of it

00:26:06.585 --> 00:26:08.379
you didn't want me
to talk to you in school.

00:26:09.088 --> 00:26:10.547
Didn't you hate me back then?

00:26:11.340 --> 00:26:12.841
I still do.

00:26:18.389 --> 00:26:20.307
Then why did you let me see her?

00:26:23.060 --> 00:26:24.436
Don't you like Ah-jin?

00:26:27.022 --> 00:26:28.107
Does it look like it?

00:26:29.149 --> 00:26:30.776
Wow, you're serious.

00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:32.361
That pisses me off.

00:26:32.778 --> 00:26:35.823
I just want her to live
an ordinary life.

00:26:36.532 --> 00:26:37.991
That's why I need you.

00:26:39.410 --> 00:26:42.204
Because she's more likely to live
a normal life

00:26:43.122 --> 00:26:46.583
through you, rather than me.

00:26:48.877 --> 00:26:50.254
What are you talking about?

00:26:50.838 --> 00:26:53.006
Make it simple for me to understand.

00:26:53.090 --> 00:26:54.842
Didn't you see her smile earlier?

00:26:56.176 --> 00:26:58.387
She rarely smiles like that.

00:27:08.439 --> 00:27:09.857
How does she usually smile?

00:27:20.868 --> 00:27:22.870
Hi everyone, I'm Baek Ah-jin.

00:27:24.955 --> 00:27:27.875
Today is my first shoot with Dazy.

00:27:27.958 --> 00:27:30.711
Fashionable and trendy style...

00:27:42.973 --> 00:27:45.100
He didn't stand out at first.

00:27:45.559 --> 00:27:48.645
But he took off after being
a substitute host on a music show.

00:27:48.729 --> 00:27:49.730
HEO IN-GANG WINS AT BLUEDRAGON AWARDS

00:27:49.813 --> 00:27:52.524
Then he switched to acting,
met Longstar's CEO, Seo Mi-ri

00:27:52.608 --> 00:27:53.776
and became a star.

00:27:54.777 --> 00:27:56.236
Maybe because
he's been working nonstop

00:27:56.320 --> 00:27:59.615
he's dealing with depression,
panic disorder, and maybe alcoholism.

00:28:00.741 --> 00:28:05.662
He still feels guilty about that
substitute host gig from years ago.

00:28:07.414 --> 00:28:09.416
He must think he's being punished.

00:28:10.501 --> 00:28:12.753
Both his parents died
when he was little.

00:28:12.836 --> 00:28:15.756
His dad died in a car accident
when he was eight.

00:28:15.839 --> 00:28:17.424
A year later,
on his dad's memorial day

00:28:17.508 --> 00:28:18.717
his mom took her own life.

00:28:19.176 --> 00:28:22.221
He and his younger brother were
raised by their maternal grandmother.

00:28:22.304 --> 00:28:23.764
I LOVE YOU, GRANDMA
I MISS YOU

00:28:24.181 --> 00:28:26.225
He's still really close to her.

00:28:27.851 --> 00:28:30.437
He always goes to his grandma's
on days off.

00:28:32.189 --> 00:28:35.359
No matter how tired he is,
he always answers her calls.

00:28:38.862 --> 00:28:40.239
Kitty.

00:28:40.322 --> 00:28:42.324
Why did you come alone?

00:28:42.825 --> 00:28:44.451
It's well-known among his fans.

00:28:45.702 --> 00:28:47.579
For In-gang, his grandma is

00:28:48.080 --> 00:28:49.373
the only real anchor.

00:28:51.208 --> 00:28:53.502
NAME: HONG KYUNG-SUK,
HOME: K APARTMENT, YEONDU-DONG

00:28:58.549 --> 00:29:00.634
MY DAUGHTER EUN-A'S FAVORITE FOOD
MY GRANDSONS' FAVORITE FOOD

00:29:03.345 --> 00:29:06.265
IN-GANG WILL BE ON TV TONIGHT
AS AN AWARD SHOW HOST, EUN-A

00:29:06.348 --> 00:29:09.017
CLAPPING
HAND EXERCISES

00:29:09.101 --> 00:29:14.189
HUMAN BEINGS EVENTUALLY
GROW UP IN LONELINESS

00:29:14.690 --> 00:29:15.816
VOLUNTEER WORK

00:29:15.899 --> 00:29:18.485
VISIT EUNGWAN TEMPLE
ON THE DAY OF THE FULL MOON

00:29:25.576 --> 00:29:27.619
THE SPIRIT OF THE LATE LIM SUN-YE

00:29:59.192 --> 00:30:02.029
I've never seen anyone
come alone to perform memorial rites.

00:30:02.112 --> 00:30:03.488
Maybe she has no family.

00:30:03.572 --> 00:30:05.866
I heard she's an actress.

00:30:05.949 --> 00:30:07.910
- An up-and-comer, they say.
- Yes.

00:30:07.993 --> 00:30:10.329
She's mostly in films,
so we wouldn't know.

00:30:10.412 --> 00:30:11.705
I see.

00:30:14.207 --> 00:30:16.209
Yesterday's move
must have been rough.

00:30:16.293 --> 00:30:18.837
Yes, I haven't even
finished unpacking.

00:30:18.921 --> 00:30:20.756
Thanks for finding me the place.

00:30:21.340 --> 00:30:23.008
- Do you like it?
- Yes.

00:30:23.091 --> 00:30:25.052
It's close to the office
and super nice.

00:30:27.137 --> 00:30:29.139
Tell me if you need anything else.

00:30:29.222 --> 00:30:31.433
I'll bring it as a housewarming gift.

00:30:33.060 --> 00:30:36.271
JINSIU RICE CAKE

00:30:45.113 --> 00:30:46.114
Hey, Ah-jin.

00:30:47.032 --> 00:30:48.367
Goodness.

00:30:48.450 --> 00:30:49.618
Wait.

00:30:49.701 --> 00:30:51.036
What's all this?

00:30:51.453 --> 00:30:52.621
Sorry.

00:30:52.704 --> 00:30:56.833
I ordered by text when I was busy
and typed the wrong number.

00:30:57.626 --> 00:31:00.045
This is a four-story building.
I'll give these out on the top floor.

00:31:01.755 --> 00:31:05.008
Promise me you won't tell Ms. Seo.

00:31:05.550 --> 00:31:07.386
I promise. Let's go inside.

00:31:10.347 --> 00:31:16.019
HOME: UNIT 401, BUILDING B,
K APARTMENT, YEONDU-DONG

00:31:38.375 --> 00:31:39.626
Hello.

00:31:39.710 --> 00:31:42.838
I just moved in downstairs
and brought some rice cakes.

00:31:42.921 --> 00:31:44.840
Oh, my. Thank you.

00:31:45.340 --> 00:31:47.676
What a sweet young lady.

00:31:48.260 --> 00:31:50.595
Not at all. I hope you enjoy them.

00:31:51.346 --> 00:31:55.726
Did you happen to visit
Eungwan Temple not long ago?

00:31:56.518 --> 00:31:58.353
Yes, I did.

00:31:58.437 --> 00:32:00.564
What a nice surprise.

00:32:00.647 --> 00:32:01.982
We meet again.

00:32:03.150 --> 00:32:04.401
Do you live here?

00:32:04.484 --> 00:32:07.070
No, a friend of mine just moved in.

00:32:10.574 --> 00:32:13.618
Do you have time?

00:32:14.369 --> 00:32:17.039
Today's the day my daughter visits

00:32:17.122 --> 00:32:20.042
so I cooked way too much.

00:32:21.001 --> 00:32:25.088
If it's not a bother,
would you come in for a quick meal?

00:32:30.510 --> 00:32:31.678
Yes, Grandma.

00:32:31.762 --> 00:32:33.096
I'm on my way now.

00:32:34.139 --> 00:32:35.807
Aunt might be late.

00:32:35.891 --> 00:32:37.559
Did you cook a feast again?

00:32:39.728 --> 00:32:42.064
I told you not to wear yourself out.

00:32:44.816 --> 00:32:45.817
What?

00:32:46.151 --> 00:32:48.111
Who's at your place?

00:32:54.826 --> 00:32:57.996
It's my daughter's memorial today.

00:33:00.332 --> 00:33:02.667
She was in such a hurry
to leave this world

00:33:02.751 --> 00:33:04.669
that she went before me.

00:33:05.712 --> 00:33:07.672
It's the one day in a year she comes

00:33:08.256 --> 00:33:11.218
so I made all her favorite dishes

00:33:11.301 --> 00:33:13.136
and I overdid it again.

00:33:13.220 --> 00:33:14.721
Oh, dear.

00:33:15.472 --> 00:33:16.765
Thank you for the food.

00:33:18.642 --> 00:33:19.810
Help yourself.

00:33:35.325 --> 00:33:36.326
What's wrong?

00:33:36.409 --> 00:33:38.370
There's nothing you like?

00:33:57.055 --> 00:33:58.140
Ah-jin.

00:33:59.766 --> 00:34:00.809
Step outside.

00:34:00.892 --> 00:34:02.185
In-gang, what are you doing?

00:34:02.269 --> 00:34:03.562
Don't be rude to a guest.

00:34:10.068 --> 00:34:11.361
Get up.

00:34:18.076 --> 00:34:19.953
In-gang!

00:34:32.132 --> 00:34:33.341
What's this?

00:34:34.301 --> 00:34:36.344
Is this really
the kind of person you are?

00:34:37.929 --> 00:34:39.097
In-gang.

00:34:39.389 --> 00:34:41.433
There's been a misunderstanding.

00:34:41.516 --> 00:34:43.476
- She and I met by chance--
- By chance?

00:34:45.395 --> 00:34:47.606
You're unbelievable.

00:34:50.609 --> 00:34:52.485
What did I do wrong?

00:34:53.570 --> 00:34:55.906
I don't see why you're so angry.

00:34:55.989 --> 00:34:56.990
You seriously don't?

00:34:58.450 --> 00:34:59.576
Then explain it.

00:35:01.828 --> 00:35:05.248
Why are you in my grandma's house,
and with what intention?

00:35:13.215 --> 00:35:15.008
Hyang-i moved in here.

00:35:16.092 --> 00:35:18.470
I came to help her
hand out rice cakes

00:35:18.803 --> 00:35:20.222
and ended up going inside.

00:35:21.056 --> 00:35:23.350
I had no idea
it was your grandma's place.

00:35:25.477 --> 00:35:26.978
Do I need to explain more?

00:35:28.480 --> 00:35:29.481
So, you didn't know?

00:35:31.274 --> 00:35:32.901
All of this was a coincidence?

00:35:34.319 --> 00:35:36.488
- You expect me to believe that?
- I'm sorry

00:35:37.405 --> 00:35:39.991
but your grandma invited me first.

00:35:40.784 --> 00:35:42.786
She said she cooked a lot
for her daughter's memorial

00:35:42.869 --> 00:35:43.954
and asked me to join.

00:35:44.496 --> 00:35:45.956
How could I say no?

00:35:46.998 --> 00:35:49.251
I guess you don't care
about her opinion at all.

00:35:49.334 --> 00:35:51.002
I don't want to hear anymore. Go.

00:35:52.045 --> 00:35:53.129
Leave.

00:35:57.467 --> 00:35:59.261
At least one thing's clear.

00:36:02.097 --> 00:36:03.932
You're still haunted.

00:36:07.394 --> 00:36:08.395
What?

00:36:10.272 --> 00:36:12.899
The advice you gave me last time.

00:36:14.025 --> 00:36:17.028
You told me to stop torturing myself.

00:36:20.282 --> 00:36:23.076
But you're the one tightening
the noose around your neck.

00:36:26.413 --> 00:36:28.832
The one who's overstepping
and tormenting me

00:36:30.292 --> 00:36:31.376
is you.

00:36:35.213 --> 00:36:38.008
Then what did you mean
when you said that to me?

00:36:39.426 --> 00:36:43.888
You exposed your flaws
to give me advice

00:36:44.347 --> 00:36:45.807
so I mistook it for something more.

00:36:47.559 --> 00:36:49.644
Why would you push me away like that?

00:36:50.478 --> 00:36:51.521
I guess...

00:36:52.522 --> 00:36:54.774
that's how you've lived
your whole life.

00:36:59.821 --> 00:37:01.364
Are you saying I'm the one at fault?

00:37:04.784 --> 00:37:06.870
Do you know
what people say about you?

00:37:09.414 --> 00:37:10.623
That you'll die soon.

00:37:12.125 --> 00:37:14.711
That you look lonely and on edge.

00:37:17.005 --> 00:37:19.174
They act concerned behind your back

00:37:19.257 --> 00:37:20.842
but no one has the guts to tell you.

00:37:22.427 --> 00:37:23.511
But I...

00:37:25.722 --> 00:37:27.640
genuinely worry about you.

00:37:29.768 --> 00:37:32.395
You look unstable,
so I can't pretend I don't see it.

00:37:36.775 --> 00:37:38.318
I didn't ask you to.

00:37:40.987 --> 00:37:42.739
Don't show up in front of me again.

00:37:46.659 --> 00:37:47.911
I really liked you...

00:37:50.163 --> 00:37:51.915
as a person

00:37:51.998 --> 00:37:53.500
and respected you as an actor.

00:37:56.836 --> 00:37:58.296
I guess I was wrong.

00:38:01.091 --> 00:38:02.759
You're nothing but a coward.

00:38:13.395 --> 00:38:16.231
Anyway, I'm sorry
for causing a misunderstanding.

00:38:16.314 --> 00:38:17.440
That's on me.

00:38:19.776 --> 00:38:20.860
I apologize.

00:38:43.800 --> 00:38:46.261
Isn't it time you told me your plan?

00:38:46.845 --> 00:38:49.305
What are you trying to do
with Heo In-gang?

00:38:49.681 --> 00:38:50.807
Jun-seo.

00:38:51.516 --> 00:38:54.310
I told you. I'm going to date him.

00:38:59.858 --> 00:39:02.902
I thought I've done enough
for two years, but I was wrong.

00:39:06.114 --> 00:39:07.157
You know

00:39:08.199 --> 00:39:10.285
how anxious I am right now.

00:39:16.666 --> 00:39:19.294
And Heo In-gang is

00:39:20.170 --> 00:39:23.214
just a step that I need
in my current situation.

00:39:23.756 --> 00:39:26.384
A lovely set of steps

00:39:26.759 --> 00:39:28.428
that will help me get to the top.

00:39:46.237 --> 00:39:48.198
THE SPIRITS OF THE LATE
MS. KIM AND MR. HEO

00:40:58.768 --> 00:41:00.603
I told you not to let
just anyone in here.

00:41:00.687 --> 00:41:02.188
Why don't you ever listen?

00:41:02.272 --> 00:41:03.565
She was my guest.

00:41:04.065 --> 00:41:05.358
Even if I'm old

00:41:05.441 --> 00:41:08.361
I can still tell
who's approaching me with a purpose.

00:41:08.444 --> 00:41:10.280
You made a big mistake today.

00:41:10.613 --> 00:41:13.074
Apologize when you see
that young lady again.

00:41:13.157 --> 00:41:14.200
You're wrong.

00:41:15.285 --> 00:41:17.704
There are so many dangerous people
in this line of work.

00:41:18.288 --> 00:41:19.455
You have no idea.

00:41:20.331 --> 00:41:21.583
You know what?

00:41:21.958 --> 00:41:23.918
Heo In-gang blew up at me today.

00:41:24.627 --> 00:41:28.131
He grilled me about whether
I approached his grandma on purpose.

00:41:34.095 --> 00:41:35.930
To be honest, it was annoying.

00:41:37.056 --> 00:41:39.517
My original plan was
to meet his grandma only.

00:41:40.768 --> 00:41:44.022
I lost my temper
and said whatever came to mind

00:41:44.689 --> 00:41:46.482
and his face changed.

00:41:47.233 --> 00:41:48.568
I wonder

00:41:48.651 --> 00:41:50.028
which part of what I said

00:41:50.945 --> 00:41:53.531
touched his heart.

00:41:55.825 --> 00:41:57.493
Did it make him sad

00:41:58.870 --> 00:42:00.163
or surprised?

00:42:04.667 --> 00:42:07.170
Grandma, I'm heading out.

00:42:11.424 --> 00:42:13.051
Take this with you.

00:42:16.054 --> 00:42:20.016
I should have put myself
in your shoes.

00:42:20.350 --> 00:42:21.392
I'm sorry.

00:42:22.101 --> 00:42:25.980
But you can't go through life
being too calculating

00:42:26.314 --> 00:42:28.358
and pushing people away.

00:42:29.150 --> 00:42:30.234
Well, you know...

00:42:31.277 --> 00:42:33.154
I'm at the end of the road

00:42:33.613 --> 00:42:37.075
but you kids have a long way to go.

00:42:37.158 --> 00:42:38.743
In the end

00:42:38.826 --> 00:42:40.870
you'll have to lean on other people.

00:42:46.084 --> 00:42:47.085
Just

00:42:47.877 --> 00:42:50.922
listen to your heart and follow it.

00:42:55.343 --> 00:42:56.344
I will.

00:43:34.590 --> 00:43:35.967
Today was a win.

00:43:37.093 --> 00:43:41.305
I'll find out how he reacts
tomorrow or the next day.

00:43:43.099 --> 00:43:44.267
I can't wait.

00:43:50.231 --> 00:43:51.232
Ah-jin.

00:43:53.651 --> 00:43:55.319
Don't worry, Jun-seo.

00:43:55.778 --> 00:43:57.572
I'll date him for exactly a year.

00:43:58.656 --> 00:44:00.074
That's all I need.

00:44:17.008 --> 00:44:19.010
GEUMHWADANG BAKERY CAFÉ

00:44:25.641 --> 00:44:29.479
Director Sung suggested
that we meet here, so I said okay.

00:44:31.355 --> 00:44:32.648
Are you sure you're fine?

00:44:33.316 --> 00:44:34.942
I'm fine. Who cares?

00:44:41.866 --> 00:44:43.534
- We'll meet again next time.
- Sure.

00:44:44.160 --> 00:44:45.161
Take care.

00:44:46.037 --> 00:44:47.079
In-gang.

00:44:50.249 --> 00:44:54.295
I booked Geumhwadang like you asked

00:44:55.129 --> 00:44:56.923
but I'm not sure about this.

00:44:57.006 --> 00:44:58.216
Thanks for your work.

00:44:58.633 --> 00:45:00.343
Anyway, I did as you asked.

00:45:00.802 --> 00:45:03.679
Even if anything goes wrong,
leave me out of it.

00:45:04.806 --> 00:45:06.808
I'll handle whatever comes.

00:45:06.891 --> 00:45:08.684
Don't you worry.

00:45:29.413 --> 00:45:30.790
This is our new dessert.

00:45:30.873 --> 00:45:31.916
Try it.

00:45:38.047 --> 00:45:40.174
It took a lot of trial and error
to nail the taste.

00:45:40.258 --> 00:45:42.051
It reminded me of our trainee days.

00:45:42.134 --> 00:45:44.679
I thought being an idol singer
was the toughest job back then

00:45:44.762 --> 00:45:46.389
but once I lived another life

00:45:46.889 --> 00:45:48.724
I realized that nothing was easy.

00:45:49.600 --> 00:45:51.811
- Are you doing well?
- Of course.

00:45:53.271 --> 00:45:54.856
That's why I came to see you.

00:45:55.398 --> 00:45:56.774
And I had something to say.

00:45:58.484 --> 00:46:00.736
I actually knew it back then.

00:46:02.488 --> 00:46:04.824
That the macarons had nuts inside.

00:46:06.784 --> 00:46:09.662
And I knew you saw it
and said nothing.

00:46:11.038 --> 00:46:12.039
But you know what?

00:46:12.832 --> 00:46:14.959
I ate them on purpose
from the first place.

00:46:16.377 --> 00:46:17.837
Because I was living in hell.

00:46:19.881 --> 00:46:24.010
The music on stage
made it hard to breathe.

00:46:24.552 --> 00:46:27.471
I felt like I'd die if I didn't quit.

00:46:28.222 --> 00:46:29.223
So, I ate them

00:46:29.891 --> 00:46:32.226
knowing they had nuts in them.

00:46:32.935 --> 00:46:36.814
So, stop carrying guilt
about stepping in

00:46:38.399 --> 00:46:39.817
as a substitute host that day.

00:46:42.069 --> 00:46:44.030
Is this some sudden confession?

00:46:45.114 --> 00:46:48.200
I knew my messages
would make you suffer.

00:46:48.618 --> 00:46:50.786
So, I'm sorry
for sending them anyway.

00:46:51.829 --> 00:46:53.497
I'm getting married soon.

00:46:53.581 --> 00:46:55.416
I'm more at peace than ever.

00:46:56.459 --> 00:46:57.460
Maybe it's time...

00:46:59.003 --> 00:47:00.588
you let go.

00:47:05.259 --> 00:47:06.302
No, In-gang.

00:47:07.261 --> 00:47:08.304
Calm down.

00:47:19.398 --> 00:47:20.775
Was her name Baek Ah-jin?

00:47:21.192 --> 00:47:22.735
She came to see me.

00:47:23.277 --> 00:47:24.528
I don't know how she knew

00:47:25.363 --> 00:47:26.864
but she asked about back then.

00:47:27.490 --> 00:47:30.826
"Does he know
that I knew and said nothing?

00:47:30.910 --> 00:47:33.913
Is he getting back at me
by texting me

00:47:33.996 --> 00:47:36.791
or does he really wish me well?"

00:47:36.874 --> 00:47:39.669
Whichever it is,
both are hell for me.

00:47:40.461 --> 00:47:43.464
So, I told her,
and she asked me for help.

00:47:43.798 --> 00:47:46.801
She said you were tormented
and that she wanted my help.

00:47:47.301 --> 00:47:48.844
She seemed like a good person.

00:47:48.928 --> 00:47:50.596
It also looked
like she really cared for you.

00:47:54.183 --> 00:47:55.184
I'm sorry.

00:48:09.448 --> 00:48:10.574
In-gang, what's wrong?

00:48:15.663 --> 00:48:19.083
I went to the awards and shot a drama
with her because you asked

00:48:19.417 --> 00:48:21.460
but I don't want to be involved
with Baek Ah-jin anymore.

00:48:22.086 --> 00:48:25.172
You never complained,
whatever the gig was.

00:48:25.756 --> 00:48:27.550
But this one bothers you?

00:48:28.801 --> 00:48:29.802
Why?

00:48:30.094 --> 00:48:31.679
Did she make a mistake?

00:48:32.138 --> 00:48:35.141
Somehow, she keeps overstepping.
It makes me uncomfortable.

00:48:35.224 --> 00:48:37.893
And I broke up with Lena for good,
so put out the breakup news soon.

00:48:39.729 --> 00:48:40.771
Got it.

00:48:41.981 --> 00:48:43.065
Thanks.

00:48:43.149 --> 00:48:45.151
No need to thank me. That's a given.

00:48:54.201 --> 00:48:56.370
Actors Heo In-gang and Lena
have ended

00:48:56.454 --> 00:48:58.873
their public relationship
after a year.

00:48:58.956 --> 00:49:01.667
Their agency, Longstar Entertainment

00:49:01.959 --> 00:49:04.962
said their busy schedules
created distance

00:49:05.046 --> 00:49:08.340
and they decided to return
to being colleagues.

00:49:08.424 --> 00:49:10.885
Many fans are disappointed

00:49:10.968 --> 00:49:13.220
as the two were seen
as a great match.

00:49:14.847 --> 00:49:16.140
What are you doing?

00:49:16.223 --> 00:49:18.934
Are you even looking into it?
Why is it taking so long?

00:49:20.436 --> 00:49:22.605
And stop whining!

00:49:25.107 --> 00:49:26.859
Don't you realize
the monthly support I give you

00:49:26.942 --> 00:49:28.402
is more than your salary?

00:49:28.486 --> 00:49:30.946
Do your job right before I fire you.

00:49:31.947 --> 00:49:33.240
Damn it.

00:49:34.700 --> 00:49:35.701
That bitch...

00:49:36.952 --> 00:49:38.079
Goddamn it!

00:49:48.631 --> 00:49:49.673
It's me.

00:49:50.132 --> 00:49:52.259
The materials we discussed are ready.

00:49:52.843 --> 00:49:54.970
Can we meet where we did last time?

00:49:55.054 --> 00:49:56.055
In about an hour.

00:49:56.972 --> 00:49:57.973
Okay.

00:50:13.405 --> 00:50:14.490
Gosh.

00:50:16.742 --> 00:50:18.202
You're that guy from before.

00:50:18.285 --> 00:50:19.328
So what?

00:50:19.411 --> 00:50:21.539
- Happy to see me?
- Yeah, sure.

00:50:21.956 --> 00:50:24.834
How dare you do this
in broad daylight--

00:50:26.043 --> 00:50:29.547
You took bribes to bury a case
when you were on the narcotics squad.

00:50:29.630 --> 00:50:32.633
My life's already in the gutter!

00:50:32.716 --> 00:50:34.718
But it's a different story
with a celebrity.

00:50:34.802 --> 00:50:38.722
One word from me, and Baek Ah-jin
will disappear without a--

00:50:41.267 --> 00:50:44.395
Your daughter
did drugs in the States.

00:50:46.564 --> 00:50:48.774
Try burying that one, too.

00:50:48.858 --> 00:50:50.651
PERSONAL DETAILS

00:50:52.862 --> 00:50:54.405
PARK DAE-HO

00:50:57.324 --> 00:50:59.201
The suspicions about Baek Ah-jin

00:50:59.285 --> 00:51:01.203
in the Nojeong-dong murder case
aren't true.

00:51:01.287 --> 00:51:02.746
There's no file.

00:51:03.414 --> 00:51:05.916
The person you've called
can't be reached--

00:51:06.000 --> 00:51:07.376
Shit.

00:51:08.085 --> 00:51:09.753
She probably got to him first.

00:51:09.837 --> 00:51:11.046
I told you so.

00:51:11.130 --> 00:51:13.132
She's not an easy target.

00:51:13.215 --> 00:51:14.508
This won't be simple.

00:51:14.592 --> 00:51:17.178
That's what amateurs say.

00:51:17.261 --> 00:51:19.972
I wire you ten million won
every month

00:51:20.055 --> 00:51:23.017
but all you do is
leave a few comments on my articles.

00:51:23.100 --> 00:51:24.560
Aren't you taking it a bit too far?

00:51:24.643 --> 00:51:27.605
Don't get touchy
about hearing this from your cousin.

00:51:27.688 --> 00:51:29.899
It's not a small amount
to let pride get in the way.

00:51:31.233 --> 00:51:34.612
Also, don't you dare
whine in front of me again.

00:51:35.821 --> 00:51:37.156
Earn

00:51:38.282 --> 00:51:39.450
what you're paid.

00:51:40.743 --> 00:51:42.703
That reporter
Lieutenant Park was trying to contact

00:51:43.954 --> 00:51:45.789
only writes hit pieces on Boss.

00:51:47.666 --> 00:51:48.709
Lim Hee-kook?

00:51:49.043 --> 00:51:50.544
Yes, that's his name.

00:51:50.628 --> 00:51:54.048
He writes nothing but good things
about Lena or something.

00:51:54.131 --> 00:51:56.800
It turns out they're related.

00:51:58.761 --> 00:52:00.846
I'll talk to Lena.

00:52:02.765 --> 00:52:03.766
What?

00:52:04.350 --> 00:52:05.768
You know her?

00:52:05.851 --> 00:52:08.395
I hear she's been bullying Ah-jin.

00:52:08.479 --> 00:52:09.480
What?

00:52:09.563 --> 00:52:11.899
Jeez, she's unhinged.

00:52:11.982 --> 00:52:14.276
Why keep poking Ah-jin
when she's done nothing?

00:52:17.029 --> 00:52:19.990
By the way,
Ah-jin says she'll date him.

00:52:20.824 --> 00:52:21.825
Is that true?

00:52:21.909 --> 00:52:23.619
That's her next move.

00:52:23.702 --> 00:52:25.454
I thought you two were
into each other.

00:52:31.502 --> 00:52:32.878
You're pathetic.

00:52:33.254 --> 00:52:34.338
If I were you...

00:52:37.466 --> 00:52:38.467
You know what?

00:52:39.677 --> 00:52:40.719
Forget it.

00:52:44.348 --> 00:52:45.891
Man.

00:52:54.900 --> 00:52:56.318
Oh, how did you...

00:52:57.236 --> 00:53:00.948
I couldn't get you off my mind
after that night.

00:53:01.824 --> 00:53:03.117
Take a seat.

00:53:07.288 --> 00:53:09.206
I should have come to you first.

00:53:09.290 --> 00:53:10.958
I wanted to apologize.

00:53:12.167 --> 00:53:14.378
And to see you again.

00:53:15.421 --> 00:53:16.755
I'm sorry.

00:53:16.839 --> 00:53:18.924
My boy has been hurt before.

00:53:19.258 --> 00:53:22.469
I told him not to do that.

00:53:22.845 --> 00:53:24.138
Please don't hold it against him.

00:53:26.056 --> 00:53:27.891
He lost his parents in his childhood

00:53:28.642 --> 00:53:30.269
and I raised him.

00:53:31.312 --> 00:53:32.313
Yes, I know.

00:53:35.274 --> 00:53:36.525
I understand.

00:53:37.234 --> 00:53:41.447
I also lost my parents
when I was little.

00:53:41.864 --> 00:53:44.366
Oh, I see.

00:53:46.702 --> 00:53:50.497
But can I ask you something?

00:53:50.873 --> 00:53:52.166
Of course.

00:53:52.541 --> 00:53:55.377
Why did you cry that night?

00:53:59.631 --> 00:54:03.802
Because it reminded me
of my late mom.

00:54:04.928 --> 00:54:09.266
She used to love spring greens.

00:54:09.350 --> 00:54:11.560
MY DAUGHTER EUN-A'S FAVORITE FOOD
SPRING GREENS, FRESH KIMCHI...

00:54:15.689 --> 00:54:17.358
Sorry, I can't stop myself.

00:54:18.150 --> 00:54:20.235
Please don't worry
about what happened.

00:54:34.291 --> 00:54:35.793
Don't worry, Jun-seo.

00:54:36.752 --> 00:54:38.629
I'll date him for exactly a year.

00:54:39.880 --> 00:54:41.256
Don't go.

00:54:48.389 --> 00:54:49.765
Just stay with me.

00:54:51.642 --> 00:54:53.310
That's all I need.

00:55:09.326 --> 00:55:11.495
Do you know
what people say about you?

00:55:12.204 --> 00:55:13.372
That you'll die soon.

00:55:20.629 --> 00:55:22.381
That you look lonely and on edge.

00:55:23.257 --> 00:55:25.134
I genuinely worry about you.

00:55:25.676 --> 00:55:27.094
I didn't ask you to.

00:55:27.803 --> 00:55:29.179
I really liked you

00:55:29.596 --> 00:55:31.557
as a person

00:55:31.640 --> 00:55:32.975
and respected you as an actor.

00:55:33.058 --> 00:55:34.476
I guess I was wrong.

00:55:40.065 --> 00:55:41.608
You're nothing but a coward.

00:55:50.325 --> 00:55:51.910
You'll stay with me, right?

00:55:54.788 --> 00:55:56.832
Don't ever leave me again.

00:56:12.306 --> 00:56:13.932
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:56:14.016 --> 00:56:15.851
How about dinner tonight?

00:56:24.902 --> 00:56:27.070
I'M SORRY ABOUT THE OTHER DAY
HOW ABOUT DINNER TONIGHT?

00:56:42.586 --> 00:56:44.838
I'll be free around nine o'clock.

00:56:44.922 --> 00:56:46.256
How about Pavilion?

00:56:55.182 --> 00:56:56.183
No way.

00:56:57.476 --> 00:56:58.519
It's Ah-jin.

00:57:06.735 --> 00:57:08.487
Gosh.

00:57:08.570 --> 00:57:12.366
Kim Jae-oh is a big shot now,
visiting a celebrity's place.

00:57:17.287 --> 00:57:18.497
What's with the suit?

00:57:19.373 --> 00:57:20.541
Where were you?

00:57:20.958 --> 00:57:23.126
My brother's graduation.

00:57:23.210 --> 00:57:27.464
Shouldn't you be eating with him
instead of coming here?

00:57:28.757 --> 00:57:30.175
I wish I could

00:57:31.593 --> 00:57:33.053
but he won't see me.

00:57:35.305 --> 00:57:36.306
Well...

00:57:38.433 --> 00:57:39.434
I get it, though.

00:57:40.269 --> 00:57:41.270
Why?

00:57:42.104 --> 00:57:43.438
Because you're a murderer?

00:57:49.152 --> 00:57:50.362
Your brother is an idiot.

00:57:50.821 --> 00:57:53.115
I would have kept you close.

00:57:53.782 --> 00:57:54.866
Am I wrong?

00:57:55.367 --> 00:57:56.994
A brother who would do
anything for me.

00:57:57.327 --> 00:57:58.787
I'd stick with him for life.

00:57:59.413 --> 00:58:00.956
Your brother's a fool.

00:58:06.712 --> 00:58:09.923
You're definitely something else.

00:58:10.007 --> 00:58:11.008
You really are.

00:58:12.134 --> 00:58:15.679
But for the record,
he's smart as hell.

00:58:16.054 --> 00:58:17.764
His grades are amazing.

00:58:18.932 --> 00:58:20.267
He's nothing like me.

00:58:26.023 --> 00:58:27.024
So, why am I here?

00:58:27.774 --> 00:58:28.817
What's up?

00:58:28.900 --> 00:58:30.235
Jae-oh.

00:58:30.319 --> 00:58:31.945
Can I ask you a favor?

00:58:32.571 --> 00:58:35.032
Of course, anything for you.

01:00:12.796 --> 01:00:13.797
Shit.

01:00:14.631 --> 01:00:17.884
Who turns the wheel like that
out of nowhere?

01:00:18.468 --> 01:00:19.678
Are you okay?

01:00:19.761 --> 01:00:23.098
Call Longstar, and they'll handle it.
I'm in a bit of a hurry.

01:00:23.181 --> 01:00:24.266
Hold up.

01:00:25.100 --> 01:00:26.101
You're a celebrity.

01:00:26.685 --> 01:00:29.980
You are. Right, you're Heo...

01:00:30.063 --> 01:00:31.273
Heo.

01:00:31.523 --> 01:00:32.899
Gosh.

01:00:32.983 --> 01:00:35.318
I've never met a celeb in real life.

01:00:35.402 --> 01:00:37.863
I thought you'd be crazy handsome.

01:00:39.197 --> 01:00:40.407
Not so impressive, though.

01:00:43.410 --> 01:00:45.078
Your tire's blown.

01:00:46.121 --> 01:00:47.789
Wait, wow.

01:00:47.873 --> 01:00:50.709
Jeez, this is bad.

01:00:53.503 --> 01:00:57.132
Anyway, it looks
like I'm partly at fault.

01:00:59.217 --> 01:01:00.927
Even my phone's cracked.

01:01:01.678 --> 01:01:04.306
Let me borrow your phone
to call the insurance.

01:01:04.931 --> 01:01:06.933
No, it's fine. I'm late.

01:01:07.017 --> 01:01:08.101
Stop.

01:01:08.602 --> 01:01:09.895
Where do you think you're going?

01:01:09.978 --> 01:01:13.190
You're going to call the police
and say I'm a hit-and-run, right?

01:01:13.273 --> 01:01:14.733
I won't.

01:01:15.192 --> 01:01:16.610
And I won't charge you
for the repair.

01:01:16.693 --> 01:01:18.028
You can just go.

01:01:21.281 --> 01:01:23.158
Stall him as long as you can.

01:01:23.241 --> 01:01:24.868
Whatever it takes.

01:01:24.951 --> 01:01:27.871
Just make sure
he's late to the restaurant.

01:01:46.556 --> 01:01:48.975
Come on. Just let me use your phone.

01:01:49.059 --> 01:01:50.185
Jeez.

01:01:57.609 --> 01:01:58.860
I didn't do it.

01:01:59.611 --> 01:02:02.572
I was just holding it,
and you knocked it out.

01:02:02.656 --> 01:02:03.865
- Got it?
- Seriously.

01:02:05.325 --> 01:02:07.828
What do we do now?

01:02:07.911 --> 01:02:09.329
Shoot.

01:02:30.559 --> 01:02:32.143
What's gotten into you?

01:02:33.812 --> 01:02:35.355
You called me first.

01:02:37.649 --> 01:02:39.359
I figured you could use a friend.

01:02:40.527 --> 01:02:43.238
You don't strike me
as someone with a big circle.

01:02:46.032 --> 01:02:47.534
What's the truth

01:02:48.326 --> 01:02:49.578
with you and Ah-jin?

01:02:50.370 --> 01:02:51.454
Be honest.

01:02:53.123 --> 01:02:54.416
When we were kids

01:02:56.084 --> 01:02:57.711
our parents remarried

01:02:58.795 --> 01:03:01.214
and we lived together briefly.
She's my younger sister.

01:03:02.924 --> 01:03:04.050
"Oh, I see.

01:03:04.801 --> 01:03:06.761
She was your sister."

01:03:07.512 --> 01:03:09.055
Did you expect me to say that?

01:03:09.723 --> 01:03:11.057
Please.

01:03:12.684 --> 01:03:15.562
That's not how a man looks
at his little sister.

01:03:19.399 --> 01:03:20.442
You got me.

01:03:21.860 --> 01:03:22.861
Darn.

01:03:25.822 --> 01:03:27.073
So, it's love, huh?

01:04:14.287 --> 01:04:15.872
Sir, I'll get off here.

01:04:21.336 --> 01:04:23.463
Ma'am, we close at ten o'clock.

01:04:23.964 --> 01:04:24.965
Okay.

01:05:10.844 --> 01:05:12.721
Isn't that Baek Ah-jin?

01:05:13.263 --> 01:05:16.683
Man, her face and body are unreal.

01:05:16.766 --> 01:05:18.893
She's the pure and glamorous type.

01:05:18.977 --> 01:05:21.688
No wonder guys go crazy.

01:05:21.771 --> 01:05:23.898
With a body like that

01:05:23.982 --> 01:05:27.068
shouldn't she dress lighter
for the people?

01:05:27.152 --> 01:05:29.571
Spend the night with me, girl.

01:05:30.238 --> 01:05:31.239
Wait, who are--

01:05:34.784 --> 01:05:35.869
In-gang.

01:05:40.081 --> 01:05:41.166
You piece of--

01:05:46.087 --> 01:05:47.839
Come here. Let go.

01:05:47.922 --> 01:05:49.466
Fucking let me go!

01:05:49.549 --> 01:05:50.592
Come here.

01:06:02.270 --> 01:06:03.980
Hey.

01:06:04.064 --> 01:06:05.815
Move, hey!

01:06:05.899 --> 01:06:07.859
- Get lost!
- What?

01:06:07.942 --> 01:06:10.695
Get out of here!

01:06:11.154 --> 01:06:13.156
You two are lunatics.

01:06:14.783 --> 01:06:17.243
Jun-seo, are you okay?

01:06:17.535 --> 01:06:20.288
Jun-seo, wake up.

01:06:20.538 --> 01:06:22.415
Have you been waiting
this whole time?

01:06:23.208 --> 01:06:25.293
I couldn't reach you,
and I was worried.

01:06:25.376 --> 01:06:27.003
I couldn't just leave.

01:06:27.545 --> 01:06:28.671
I'm sorry.

01:06:28.755 --> 01:06:30.590
I got into a minor accident
on the way.

01:06:30.673 --> 01:06:32.967
My phone fell into a sewage

01:06:33.051 --> 01:06:34.886
and I couldn't remember your number.

01:06:34.969 --> 01:06:37.680
You should have gone home
if you couldn't reach me.

01:06:38.014 --> 01:06:39.849
You waited for me
in this freezing weather?

01:06:40.725 --> 01:06:42.602
I didn't want to miss you.

01:06:43.311 --> 01:06:44.813
You're here now, so it's fine.

01:06:49.609 --> 01:06:51.778
By the way,
why are you dressed so lightly?

01:06:52.570 --> 01:06:53.696
Aren't you cold?

01:07:01.204 --> 01:07:03.915
Wear a scarf next time.

01:07:03.998 --> 01:07:07.544
I know it's stuffy,
but it keeps you warm.

01:07:11.422 --> 01:07:13.383
Am I nagging?

01:07:15.426 --> 01:07:17.387
Is this too much?

01:07:39.450 --> 01:07:40.827
Yoon Jun-seo!

01:07:45.790 --> 01:07:48.668
You missed me, didn't you?

01:08:21.868 --> 01:08:23.661
Hi, I'm Baek Ah-jin.

01:08:23.745 --> 01:08:25.205
I'm Yoon Jun-seo.

01:08:37.300 --> 01:08:39.719
Jun-seo, help me.

01:08:41.888 --> 01:08:43.598
I'm always on your side.

01:08:50.021 --> 01:08:51.314
Help me.

01:08:56.653 --> 01:08:58.488
I want to learn to love him.

